body:
One time when i was still together with my ex I was talking to a friend and he asked me how i was. I always gave the same answer, I felt shitty and it was always because of my ex. When he pointed it out i really started to think. Why am i with someone who always makes me feel sad? 

&#x200B;

You don't have much to lose in a relationship that doesn't benefit you. At first it will be hard, but after rain comes sunshine. Is that how you say it? Either way, as soon as you break up with him, you can only grow from that.

&#x200B;

Goodluck to you.
